<title>UK: Airservices Australia sets A$100 mln 5-year bond.</title>
<headline>Airservices Australia sets A$100 mln 5-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Commonwealth Bank of Australia.</p>
<p> BORROWER   AIRSERVICES AUSTRALIA</p>
<p> AMT    A$100 MLN     COUPON     7.375 PCT MATURITY    15.NOV.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.64    PAY DATE    15.NOV.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.0 PCT   REOFFER    =	   SPREAD	 =</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA+	 DENOMS (K) 1-10	SALE LIMITS US/UK/AU</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.50	SELL CONC  1.50	PRAECIP     0.125</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
